WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.565 --> 00:00:02.727
New to Bizpole One?

2
00:00:02.727 --> 00:00:04.169
Here's how to use it,

3
00:00:04.169 --> 00:00:06.467
in ten simple steps.

4
00:00:07.231 --> 00:00:09.308
Starting a new company?

5
00:00:09.308 --> 00:00:10.931
Click Get Started Business,

6
00:00:10.931 --> 00:00:12.686
choose Start a New Company,

7
00:00:12.686 --> 00:00:15.210
and pick Business Registration.

8
00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:16.652
Answer each step,

9
00:00:16.652 --> 00:00:18.058
upload your documents,

10
00:00:18.058 --> 00:00:21.027
and review. Then pay online,

11
00:00:21.027 --> 00:00:23.357
or request a call back.

12
00:00:24.131 --> 00:00:26.377
Already run a company?

13
00:00:26.377 --> 00:00:28.612
Choose Onboard Existing company,

14
00:00:28.612 --> 00:00:30.139
and tell us what you need,

15
00:00:30.139 --> 00:00:32.410
from a GST registration to a change

16
00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:35.403
of address. We only ask for what's

17
00:00:35.403 --> 00:00:36.753
missing.

18
00:00:37.531 --> 00:00:39.596
Already a customer?

19
00:00:39.596 --> 00:00:41.459
Click Sign In and enter your email

20
00:00:41.459 --> 00:00:43.226
or phone number.

21
00:00:43.226 --> 00:00:45.113
Then type the four-digit code sent to

22
00:00:45.113 --> 00:00:47.417
your email and mobile.

23
00:00:48.198 --> 00:00:50.720
Choose your company at the top.

24
00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:53.208
Your dashboard shows every service and its

25
00:00:53.208 --> 00:00:56.105
status, and the sidebar takes you everywhere

26
00:00:56.105 --> 00:00:57.388
else.

27
00:00:58.165 --> 00:00:59.776
Open Pricing and Plans,

28
00:00:59.776 --> 00:01:00.881
choose your state,

29
00:01:00.881 --> 00:01:03.536
and select the services you need.

30
00:01:03.536 --> 00:01:05.038
Click Proceed to Quote,

31
00:01:05.038 --> 00:01:07.931
then review and approve your quote.

32
00:01:08.698 --> 00:01:11.605
Open My task and pick your service.

33
00:01:11.605 --> 00:01:12.626
Click a task,

34
00:01:12.626 --> 00:01:13.816
upload the file,

35
00:01:13.816 --> 00:01:15.655
and press Submit.

36
00:01:15.655 --> 00:01:17.840
It moves to In review.

37
00:01:18.631 --> 00:01:20.049
To follow progress,

38
00:01:20.049 --> 00:01:22.898
open Orders, then Individual services,

39
00:01:22.898 --> 00:01:25.047
and click View Details.

40
00:01:25.047 --> 00:01:27.965
The timeline shows where things stand.

41
00:01:28.731 --> 00:01:31.279
Finished work appears in the Deliverables tab

42
00:01:31.279 --> 00:01:33.140
under My task.

43
00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:35.448
Your invoices are in Account Settings,

44
00:01:35.448 --> 00:01:37.249
under Invoice.

45
00:01:38.065 --> 00:01:39.940
Before you file a trademark,

46
00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.198
open Trademark Search.

47
00:01:42.198 --> 00:01:43.953
Type your brand name or add your

48
00:01:43.953 --> 00:01:46.463
logo, then click Search.

49
00:01:47.398 --> 00:01:50.437
Need help? Open Customer supports,

50
00:01:50.437 --> 00:01:51.579
click New Ticket,

51
00:01:51.579 --> 00:01:52.853
choose a category,

52
00:01:52.853 --> 00:01:53.790
add a subject,

53
00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:55.508
and submit.

54
00:01:56.731 --> 00:02:00.071
That's it. Everything your business needs,

55
00:02:00.071 --> 00:02:01.837
in one place.

56
00:02:01.837 --> 00:02:04.889
Get started at bizpole.io.
